# Maison Tavo catalog and care

## Cookware
- Forge is the stainless steel cookware and fixed-set range. Vessel sizes are grouped as diameter variants.
- Chulha is the terracotta cookware range. Its vessel sizes are grouped by diameter or capacity. Materials, dimensions and use limits are subject to product validation.
- Maintenance includes care supplies and replacement parts. Check model and size compatibility before ordering.

